  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Frontier-fading agent tree (12.1).** opus plans/verifies, the local qwen worker executes, and trust is earned per task-class. Every panel is the persistent Loki event stream (`job=\"agentops\"`, one event per dispatch/verdict/escalation) over the dashboard range \u2014 the **same** events that drive the kanban board. **Local** = `qwen*`; **Frontier** = `claude-*` / `gpt-*`. The goal of fading is the two numbers up top moving in opposite directions: local task share **up**, frontier tokens (cost proxy) **down**, without local-first pass-rate dropping below the promotion bar (0.85). GPU-degraded is split **by reason** so a silent CPU-fallback (H1, `reason=cpu-fallback`) reads distinctly from a device-health degrade (S3).\n\n---\n\n**Empty is not broken (verified 2026-08-27).** Every query here targets `job=\"agentops\"`, written by `agent-pack/bin/agentops-ship.py` (`dispatch | escalation | verdict | adhoc | dispatch_start`). That vocabulary is correct and the shipper is installed \u2014 but no governed agent-pack run has executed inside Loki's 7-day retention (the only `agentops` line in the window is a `test_governed_fleet_probe` from 2026-08-26). So these panels read *No data* because the fleet has been idle on this path, **not** because the queries are wrong. Run a governed card and they populate. If they are still empty after a run, the shipper is not reaching Loki \u2014 check `agentops-ship.py --loki`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tasks completed",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"agentops\", event=\"verdict\", task=~\"$task\"} [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
